{"version": 2, "width": 65, "height": 14, "title": "Shantytown: preview the crew before launching", "env": {"TERM": "dumb"}}
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H$ st --root .shanty --backend files fleet init -y --admin \r\ncoordinator --crew '' --dry-run\r\n\r\n  store    .shanty\r\n  dir      crew/\r\n  dir      settings/\r\n  dir      events/\r\n  dir      launched/\r\n  card     coordinator  administrator  pane st-coordinator\r\n  hooks    settings/administrator.settings.json\r\n  permissions for NEW cards: MANUAL (approval prompts enabled)\r\n  config   .shanty/shantytown.toml\r\n\r\n  1 agent(s) \u00b7 startup mode 'lite' \u00b7 hibernate off\r\n"]
[6.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\r\n  --dry-run: nothing written.\r\n"]
[12.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H$ st --root .shanty --backend files fleet init -y --admin \r\ncoordinator --crew builder --dry-run\r\n\r\n  store    .shanty\r\n  dir      crew/\r\n  dir      settings/\r\n  dir      events/\r\n  dir      launched/\r\n  card     coordinator  administrator  pane st-coordinator\r\n  card     builder      worker         pane st-builder\r\n  hooks    settings/administrator.settings.json\r\n  hooks    settings/worker.settings.json\r\n  permissions for NEW cards: MANUAL (approval prompts enabled)\r\n  config   .shanty/shantytown.toml\r\n"]
[18.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\r\n  2 agent(s) \u00b7 startup mode 'lite' \u00b7 hibernate off\r\n\r\n  --dry-run: nothing written.\r\n"]
